{"id":"601055","name":"奶香紫薯包","author":"°ZWH","authorId":"11170916","desc":"","cover":"images/601055/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫薯","amount":"适量"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"炼乳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"纯牛奶","amount":"240g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"紫薯粉","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"},{"name":"糖","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"20g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"g面粉里放几勺紫薯粉，加240g纯牛奶。","img":"images/601055/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加5g酵母、1个鸡蛋、1勺糖。","img":"images/601055/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉面。","img":"images/601055/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"无干粉时加20g玉米油。","img":"images/601055/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/601055/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"烤箱饧发面团。","img":"images/601055/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"紫薯蒸熟。","img":"images/601055/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"压碎。","img":"images/601055/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"趁热加少量牛奶、炼乳、蜂蜜，搅匀。","img":"images/601055/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"面团饧发至两倍大，戳洞不回弹。","img":"images/601055/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"揉搓排气。","img":"images/601055/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"整理成长条形，切成大小均匀的小剂子。","img":"images/601055/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"擀薄。","img":"images/601055/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"包紫薯馅。","img":"images/601055/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"包好后二次饧发20分钟。","img":"images/601055/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"冷水上锅蒸，水开后转小火蒸十分钟，关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/601055/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/601055/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}